{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eastern Europe. Housing estate life. Full-time work. Exhaustion.<br>And where does it all lead?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is simple: get home every day and sleep \u2014 and thus get rid of the hallucinations.<br>But the staircase is not always the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game ends when you have found all the anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe your surroundings carefully.<br>Don't miss any changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find an anomaly, <strong>press the RED button</strong> in the elevator.<br>If you can't find it, <strong>press the GREEN button</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>When Will I Get Home?</i> is an anomaly-finding walking simulator,<br>inspired by our own staircase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Available in Hungarian and English.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playing time:</strong> 30\u2013120 minutes</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4087740?t=1770822013","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087740/aebefc873dc55cacee7b27d99ff99b8987cc1ae4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770822013","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087740/32b79d02f0baa043d6344ea41b75e273781850c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770822013","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087740/32b79d02f0baa043d6344ea41b75e273781850c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770822013","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4309250,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eastern Europe. Housing estate life. Full-time work. Exhaustion.<br>And where does it all lead?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is simple: get home every day and sleep \u2014 and thus get rid of the hallucinations.<br>But the staircase is not always the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game ends when you have found all the anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe your surroundings carefully.<br>Don't miss any changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find an anomaly, <strong>press the RED button</strong> in the elevator.<br>If you can't find it, <strong>press the GREEN button</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>When Will I Get Home?</i> is an anomaly-finding walking simulator,<br>inspired by our own staircase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Available in Hungarian and English.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playing time:</strong> 30\u2013120 minutes</p>","developers":["ZForgeGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087740/d15030c0d737da274d7346dd86f45d8a8da5ed9b/header.jpg?t=1770822013","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4087740/1278776961/c6bd5d878ff67e82a4a114718ba496b67658e23e/1762154633/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762244438","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4087740/1278776961/c6bd5d878ff67e82a4a114718ba496b67658e23e/1762154633/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762244438","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4087740/1278776961/c6bd5d878ff67e82a4a114718ba496b67658e23e/1762154633/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762244438","id":257222544,"name":"When will I get Home? trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257222544/5e7c5c93160fb824ec2c486a8c9eee1f733ec9dc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762244438"}],"name":"When will I get Home?","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 